@host = http://localhost:8416

### 1. OK → 200
POST {{host}}/api/v1/print/abc123
Content-Type: application/json

{ "drucker": "PDF" }

### 2. No printer → 400
POST {{host}}/api/v1/print/abc123
Content-Type: application/json

{ }

### 3. Bad characters → 400
POST {{host}}/api/v1/print/abc123
Content-Type: application/json

{ "drucker": "PDF; rm -rf /" }

### 4. Unknown printer → 400
POST {{host}}/api/v1/print/abc123
Content-Type: application/json

{ "drucker": "GibtEsNicht" }

### 5. Printers
GET {{host}}/api/v1/printers

### 6. Wrong token → 404
POST {{host}}/api/v1/print/falsch
Content-Type: application/json

{ "drucker": "PDF" }

### 7. Note file missing → 404, nothing printed
POST {{host}}/api/v1/print/kaputt
Content-Type: application/json

{ "drucker": "PDF" }

### 8. Damaged PDF → 422, nothing printed
POST {{host}}/api/v1/print/pdf-kaputt
Content-Type: application/json

{ "drucker": "PDF" }

### 9. Unknown format → 200, 1 of 2 pages printed
POST {{host}}/api/v1/print/letter
Content-Type: application/json

{ "drucker": "PDF" }

### 10. Bad character in token → 400
POST {{host}}/api/v1/print/abc.123
Content-Type: application/json

{ "drucker": "PDF" }

### 11. API not reachable → 502
# Close only the VM.TestApi window, then send request 1 again.

### 12. Log file
# Open bin\Debug\net10.0\logs\druckdienst-<date>.log and check the lines of tests 1–11.

### 13. Duplex → 200, 3 of 3 pages, note 2 double-sided
POST {{host}}/api/v1/print/duplex
Content-Type: application/json

{ "drucker": "PDF" }

### 14. Config check
# Put a wrong value into appsettings.json (e.g. "ApiBasisUrl": "localhost:8417") → F5 → service must not start.

### 15. Big test → 200, 500 of 500 pages
POST {{host}}/api/v1/print/gross
Content-Type: application/json
{ "drucker": "PDF" }
### 16. Note numbers as text → 200, A4 group: note 12 before 12a
POST {{host}}/api/v1/print/nummern
Content-Type: application/json

{ "drucker": "PDF" }

### 17. Health with version → {"status":"ok","version":"1.0.0"}
GET {{host}}/api/v1/health


### 19. API sends a wrong format → 502, nothing printed
POST {{host}}/api/v1/print/altformat
Content-Type: application/json

{ "drucker": "PDF" }

